title: Double Horn Honk on Keyless Exit Disable
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] Double Horn Honk on Keyless Exit Disable
category: Chimes and Horn
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Chimes and Horn] [Years: 2022-2026] [Original Title: Disable double
  honk with exit of running vehicle]

  Disables horn double honk when exiting running vehicle with keyfob. Can also be
  set in Sync (Key Detection Alert).'
steps:
- module: BCM
  address: 726-63-02
  targets:
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature: LostPKExteriorNotificationEnable_Cfg (LPKENEC)
recipe_version: '1.1'
